This is a **Zilliz/Milvus vector database MCP server** that indexes your codebase and provides semantic search capabilities to Claude via embeddings. It requires:

1. An embedding provider API key (OpenAI, VoyageAI, Gemini, etc.)
2. A Milvus instance (Zilliz Cloud or self-hosted) for storing embeddings

To configure it as an MCP server in Claude Code, you'd add it to your settings with the required env vars. For example with OpenAI embeddings + Zilliz Cloud:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "claude-context": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@zilliz/claude-context-mcp@latest"],
      "env": {
        "OPENAI_API_KEY": "sk-...",
        "MILVUS_ADDRESS": "https://your-cluster.zillizcloud.com",
        "MILVUS_TOKEN": "your-token"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Do you want me to help you configure this? If so, which embedding provider and Milvus setup are you using?
